Fix:
```javascript
const seen = new WeakSet();
const out = JSON.stringify(a, (k, v) => {
  if (typeof v === 'object' && v !== null) {
    if (seen.has(v)) return '[Circular]';
    seen.add(v);
  }
  return v;
});
```

A replacer with a `WeakSet` of visited objects substitutes a placeholder for cycles instead of throwing.

